      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "018ab488f8a7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Studying in Europe is an exciting opportunity for "
        },
        {
          "_key": "440278416978",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Nepali students"
        },
        {
          "_key": "94810e537f09",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " seeking "
        },
        {
          "_key": "49beae0a1494",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "world-class education, international exposure, and career growth"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7804d7541ab7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Europe is home to top-ranked universities, innovative programs, and multicultural environments that prepare students for global careers."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7404d7032172",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "91e23473a77e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "With "
        },
        {
          "_key": "445569a6ef0e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Admizz Education"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ba1a2b40f345",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", the journey from university selection to visa approval becomes seamless. This comprehensive guide covers "
        },
        {
          "_key": "5e51e970938a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "eligibility, scholarships, costs, top destinations, visa requirements, and expert tips"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ea968376e080",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to help Nepali students study in Europe with confidence."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bf6c3eb9da9f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "69c3da99535b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Why Choose Europe for Higher Education?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "cd0f62656e24",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "64da5af01ce4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Europe offers several advantages for international students:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ff452150cda7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "97c0e7ac14a3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "World-Class Education"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f83c5de6011f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c143c90ac45c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "European universities are globally recognized for their quality education, research opportunities, and diverse programs. Countries like "
        },
        {
          "_key": "b6bffb0f7f20",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Germany, Netherlands, Sweden, and Finland"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ba3b20b75ef3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " consistently rank among the best in engineering, business, medical sciences, and arts."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fd702a28abd9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9c1fca10c054",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Affordable Tuition Fees"
        },
        {
          "_key": "72fd11d91f2a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "b37d30e1c9e3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Many European countries provide low-cost or even "
        },
        {
          "_key": "5bd977831c5a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "tuition-free education"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0f08ba7e35ac",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " for international students. For example, public universities in Germany and Norway charge minimal tuition fees, while scholarships and financial aid further reduce costs."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bfbf6b4f81d5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "322ec0016e09",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Cultural Diversity"
        },
        {
          "_key": "19f31267ab77",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "b029082fcd64",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Studying in Europe exposes Nepali students to a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "cbb04c3dc037",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "multicultural environment"
        },
        {
          "_key": "669c87c1e7c2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", encouraging personal growth and networking with students from around the world."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9b1b40e9849d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ae18afdd80f2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Post-Study Work Opportunities"
        },
        {
          "_key": "57e613be1d0e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0a3299fa99bc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "European countries like Germany and Ireland allow students to stay and work after graduation, helping them gain international work experience and potentially apply for permanent residency."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1d5db962a98b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b819e972d203",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Travel and Lifestyle Opportunities"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8876d62edbd0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6015624ae62a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Europe offers easy travel options between countries. Students can explore cities, historical landmarks, and cultural events while studying."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "894b8e126d79",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ebc0aa4f7cf3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Therefore, studying in Europe is not just about academics; it’s a complete life experience combining education, culture, and professional exposure."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "cd887fb86a14",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "702b610ce743",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Eligibility Criteria for Nepali Students"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6271e5b95e69",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7b7c4c805722",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Before applying, Nepali students should meet the following requirements:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0c0a4202a960",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "dbf5f1733699",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Academic Qualifications"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9f4a5ed3273a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ": +2 for undergraduate courses; a Bachelor’s degree for Master’s programs."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "653b19052ea1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b7a233d60cd2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "English Proficiency"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9ab66378c343",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ": IELTS 6.0+ or TOEFL equivalent. Some universities accept a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "da0f550f284d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Medium of Instruction (MOI)"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e7d7d2ce85dd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " certificate."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3e578f699b47",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "623d5a01d2fb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Passport & Financial Proof"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e1200a2168b3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ": A valid passport and bank statements showing sufficient funds for tuition and living expenses."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "340c83ad094f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "64d347c1852f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Health Insurance"
        },
        {
          "_key": "40587999181c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ": Required in most countries for visa approval."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b078e3dce28a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "06580547cc54",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Accommodation Proof"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a0dcc9c044fb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ": Evidence of student housing or hostel arrangements."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "59a59fc6c84c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "72929b00a9dd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Some countries like Germany may require a blocked account showing sufficient funds for one year of living expenses."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8c7c8f6ba88f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fb6c20e66133",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Step-by-Step Application Process"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e51f8ca7fe2e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b2ad044cd681",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Select Your Program & University"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c1b9d066f853",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9c61f7687351",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Research universities and programs that align with your career goals. Consider factors like tuition fees, location, language of instruction, and post-study work opportunities."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "488d32697546",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d3e3e7b8c506",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Prepare Required Documents"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8349e9314925",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f8a954688f85",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Collect academic transcripts, English proficiency certificates, passport, financial proof, recommendation letters, and motivation letters."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "aa7805b75ddb",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ebf9b9d90aaa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Submit Application"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7202a28b1184",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5e9619d47ad5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Apply directly through university portals or through Admizz Education for streamlined guidance."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "eedda7083b5a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "736349db0afa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Receive Offer Letter"
        },
        {
          "_key": "cd875b666eb0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "13ee59b605b3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Once accepted, universities provide an offer letter required for student visa application."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6eeab7eed40c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9ca8975a80fa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Apply for Student Visa"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2da09f205587",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ba996c500627",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Submit your visa application along with offer letters, financial proof, accommodation proof, and health insurance."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a2f3c562314e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7cae8bbe3d4a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Prepare for Departure"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e4c4912592ab",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f9668d7c184a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Arrange travel, accommodation, and attend pre-departure orientations to get familiar with European student life."
