      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f4efe58fe9a2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "By leveraging scholarships, students can significantly reduce tuition costs and living expenses, making Europe an affordable and attractive option."
