          "_key": "e4a8128f29a2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Q1: Which European countries are best for Nepali students?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3fda1fa8aa3f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7efac3c54efc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A: Germany, Netherlands, Sweden, Finland, and Ireland are ideal due to low tuition, quality education, and post-study work options."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "df98f67d4c8e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7afe2a24f059",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Q2: Can Nepali students get scholarships in Europe?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c12428f7581e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5bbd7ab0c7ac",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A: Yes. Scholarships like Erasmus Mundus, DAAD, KTH, and Radboud are available."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "18454a28ab4a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0c71ef21b464",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Q3: How much does it cost to study in Europe from Nepal?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8f1bfb7fbdc3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "50677097fd11",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A: Tuition ranges from €0–€20,000/year. Living expenses are approximately €700–€1,500/month."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9437920fbb7e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b1749965f46e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Q4: Do I need IELTS to study in Europe?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "516dd52433f6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "1ea032baf3b0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A: Most universities require IELTS or TOEFL. Some accept a Medium of Instruction certificate if your prior education was in English."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9c55b3132acb",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0f5c7ede50fd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Q5: How long can Nepali students work in Europe after graduation?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "03937450c0b6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3e302a3b15f0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A: Many countries allow 1–3 years of post-study work visas."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
