      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f680fb42a20b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Q6: Can I work part-time while studying in Europe?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a22c6e29c155",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0e742c6ba9fd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A: Yes, most countries allow 20 hours/week during semesters and full-time during vacations."
